PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "Ah! Your reputation precedes\n"
    .string "you, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "I lead the ELITE FOUR here.\p"
    .string "LANCE is the name. Dragon\n"
    .string "TRAINER, through and through.\p"
    .string "Dragons, as I'm sure you know,\n"
    .string "are the stuff of legend.\p"
    .string "Difficult to catch, difficult to\n"
    .string "raise, but their power has no\l"
    .string "equal.\p"
    .string "Nearly indestructible, too. No\n"
    .string "clever tricks will save you here.\p"
    .string "So then. Are you prepared to\n"
    .string "lose?\p"
    .string "Your challenge ends right here\n"
    .string "with me, {PLAYER}!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Ah! Back again, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "I lead the ELITE FOUR here.\p"
    .string "LANCE is the name. Dragon\n"
    .string "TRAINER, through and through.\p"
    .string "Dragons, as I'm sure you know,\n"
