PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "That's it, that's the match.\p"
    .string "Much as it pains me to say it,\n"
    .string "you truly are a POKéMON master!$"

PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "I still can hardly believe my\n"
    .string "dragons fell to you, {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "By rights, that makes you the new\n"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "…Would, at least. There's one\n"
    .string "challenge left standing between\l"
    .string "you and that title.\p"
    .string "One more TRAINER waits beyond\n"
    .string "that door. You'll know the name.\p"
    .string "{RIVAL}.\p"
    .string "Beat the ELITE FOUR before you\n"
    .string "even got here.\p"
    .string "For now, {RIVAL} holds the title\n"
    .string "of POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION.$"

